{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212290","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121229001:0":{"text":"アルファⅪ！大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一！你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C05B96569B82BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121229002:0":{"text":"体が痛い……あめ玉を、ちょうだい……","source_cn":"身体很痛……请给我一颗糖果……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC89C6BDAF03BF3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121229003:2":{"text":"アルファⅪ、また体が痛むの？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，身体是不是又开始痛了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1533643EE937BBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121229004:0":{"text":"はっ……","source_cn":"是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CFBC882AB0D9FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121229005:0":{"text":"ふむ……間隔が短くなっているようね。","source_cn":"……嗯，正常的时间变短了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7F23351E4FC9D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121229006:0":{"text":"あなたは強い子よね。さあ、ママのところへいらっしゃい、あめ玉をあげるわ。","source_cn":"好了，你是个坚强的孩子。快到妈妈身边来吧，妈妈给你糖果吃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DC5486D1C289C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121229007:0":{"text":"あめ玉を食べれば、すぐに良くなるわ。今度は二個多めに食べるのよ。","source_cn":"只要吃下糖果，一切都会好起来。这次要多吃两颗哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52CB7F3CDA76499A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121229008:1":{"text":"ありがとう、ママ……","source_cn":"谢谢妈妈……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54C7EA0C8E646EA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121229009:0":{"text":"あめ玉は苦いけど……それを食べれば、体が痛くなくなるの。","source_cn":"虽然糖果很苦……但是只要吃下去，身体就不痛了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F126A75B1B7AE34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121229010:0":{"text":"ええ？あめ玉は甘いはずでしょ？それ、絶対にあめ玉じゃないわ。あなたは騙されてたのよ！","source_cn":"喂喂喂……糖果是甜的吧？那肯定不是什么糖果！你被骗了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6611115CC763923","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1121229011:0":{"text":"ママは、アタシを騙したりしない……","source_cn":"妈妈不会骗我的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF731BE4864EAF33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121229012:0":{"text":"アルドン様！これはいったいどういう……？","source_cn":"雅顿贤者！她这是怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC9FEE6A4EBA0D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121229013:0":{"text":"黒魔術の副作用じゃな。","source_cn":"是黑魔法的副作用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EC4FAEEE3CC736D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1121229014:2":{"text":"イルシカが何をしたのかは分からんが……どうやらこの子の体は、黒魔術に長期間汚染されていたようじゃ。","source_cn":"不知道伊露西卡具体对她做了什么……但是可以看出，她的身...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x916B74919D33AA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121229015:0":{"text":"おそらくその「あめ玉」というのは、副作用を抑える魔法薬じゃろう。","source_cn":"她吃的糖果应该是一种魔药，能够抑制住这些副作用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE67D1FCB69F5EAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121229016:0":{"text":"アルファⅪ、自分の年齢は分かるかね？","source_cn":"阿尔法十一，冒昧问一句，你知道自己多大吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91C0C18337B9E694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1121229017:0":{"text":"分からない……年齢は、覚えてない。","source_cn":"我不知道……我不记得自己的年龄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB65FEDE2D4762C24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1121229018:0":{"text":"ふむ……ライカ、ラミア、おぬしたちは一度ルナレイク村に行ってダウナエを訪ねなさい。","source_cn":"唉……莱卡、蕾米雅，你们先去一趟月湖村，去找达赫妮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA7F66D7DF3D6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121229019:0":{"text":"今のこの子の状態では、おぬしたちとバドーゾ山脈に行くのは無理じゃろう。","source_cn":"这孩子现在的状态，没法和你们一起去瓦度索山脉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD98CD77CE72FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1121229020:0":{"text":"ブライアン、エルーナを飛ばして、わしの言づてをダウナエに届けてくれ。ダウナエならどうすればいいか分かるはずじゃ。","source_cn":"布莱恩，你让艾洛娜把我的手信捎给达赫妮，她知道该怎么做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5FAC94F2712B317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121229021:0":{"text":"承知した。","source_cn":"是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A937FC73CA79F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":